=base:main-content.cmark

# Changelog: tramaj-js

Release history of `tramaj-js`, the TypeScript implementation for Node.js and browsers. Releases happen when there are
major changes rather than on a schedule; each entry below is one version.
Every implementation has its own page like this one, and each page is
tagged so the site builds one Atom feed per implementation:
#changelog #javascript #tramaj-js

=base:main-content.tramaj-doc
@version=import("changelog/version", {"package": "tramaj-js"})
.div(class: "changelog",
  $version({
      "version": "0.1.0",
      "date": "unreleased",
      "summary": "TypeScript port: parser, evaluator (concrete and symbolic modes), Node JSON codec and static analyses.",
      "changes": [
          {
              "kind": "added",
              "text": "Hand-written port checked against \`corpus/cases\` by \`test/corpus.test.ts\`."
          },
          {
              "kind": "added",
              "text": "Object destructuring patterns in \`@\` bindings and lambda parameters (decisions section 17): a parser lowering to plain \`Let\`/\`Lambda\`, checked by shared corpus cases 100-118."
          }
      ]
  }).rendered)

